<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#mapping_id_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'meanwhile at the isis strip club' maps the visual entity 'sheep' as the performers in a strip club, creating an absurd and offensive analogy. The sheep, with their rear ends facing forward, are humorously equated with strippers, while the men in turbans react with exaggerated shock, reinforcing the stereotype that they are watching an inappropriate scene."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#opaqueOverlaidOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#superimposedOn> .
