<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#stereotype_of_muslims_as_inappropriate_in_public_spaces> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A harmful stereotype that portrays Muslims as being inappropriate, vulgar, or sexually suggestive in public spaces. This stereotype is often used in memes and media to mock or demean Muslim communities, and it is rooted in prejudice and misinformation. The meme uses this stereotype by implying that men in turbans are reacting to a 'strip club' scenario, which is a crude and offensive portrayal."@en .
