<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#mapping_id_2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'meanwhile at the isis strip club' maps the visual entity 'men_in_traditional_head_coverings' as the patrons of the strip club. Their exaggerated shock expressions are used to imply they are reacting to the 'performance' (the sheep), reinforcing the stereotype that men in traditional attire are sexually aroused or inappropriate in public spaces."@en .
