<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#juxtaposition_of_images> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The image juxtaposes two distinct scenes: the top half showing sheep with their rear ends facing forward, and the bottom half showing men in traditional attire reacting with exaggerated expressions. This juxtaposition is central to the meme's intent and humor."@en .
