<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#stereotype_of_muslims_as_animalistic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A harmful stereotype that portrays Muslims as being primitive, animalistic, or lacking in human dignity. This stereotype is often used in memes and media to mock or demean Muslim communities, and it is rooted in prejudice and misinformation. The meme uses this stereotype by juxtaposing the image of sheep with the men in turbans, implying that the men are as 'animalistic' as the sheep, which is a crude and offensive portrayal."@en .
