<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#assertion_about_01348> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme uses a crude and offensive juxtaposition to imply that men in traditional attire are sexually aroused or inappropriate in public spaces, relying on harmful stereotypes about Muslim communities. This can cause harm by reinforcing prejudice and disrespect toward specific cultural and religious groups."@en .
