<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01348#men_in_traditional_head_coverings> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Three men wearing white turbans and traditional attire are shown in the bottom half of the image. They are reacting with exaggerated expressions of shock, amusement, or surprise, with one man holding his head and another with his mouth open."@en .
_:nbf72ac90c67a4388a516a8fcbbb7ae46b94 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:nbf72ac90c67a4388a516a8fcbbb7ae46b95 .
